window.products.push({"id":838028,"name":"Living Quarters Queen Electric Blanket, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511AFY+DjhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Lower your heating bill and save energy this winter with a cozy, heated microlight blanket which features an ultra-thin wire for extra comfort. Made from ultra-soft microplush fabric. The blanket is controlled by a programmable digital controller; 2 are included with queen and king sized blankets. The controller includes 10 heat settings, a preheat setting, and a 10 hour auto shut off feature, allowing you save up to 10 percent a year on your energy bill. Just turn on your heated blanket and your thermostat down by 10-15 percent for 8 hours to realize the savings. Incredibly convenient, the electric blanket is machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511AFY+DjhL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Living Quarters","source_asin":"B084MNM8K1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084MNM8K1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084MNM8K1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838029,"name":"Mino ware Japanese Ceramics Sushi Yunomi Chawan Tea Cup Large Yomogi Green made in Japan (Japan Import) YAY082","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mlks6kAtL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","description":"Please Note : This product is not one-of-a-kind. As a common feature of ceramics, details like colors, shape, glaze lines, pattern, weight, etc... are supposed to be different from the photos here to some extent.  Mino ware made in Japan About Mino ware (Mino yaki) Back in 7th century A.D., Mino ware was born in Mino region located in the center of Japan. It has more than 1300-year history. As the tea ceremony culture got popular in Azuchi-Momoyama era, Mino ware was getting popular and loved by tea meisters and aristocracies. Figure and color of Mino ware have been sophisticated as time goes by. Kizeto of yellow & ocher, Oribe of deep green glaze, Shino of white & pink glaze, and Setoguro of pure black have great reputations among ceramic lovers not only in Japan but also all over the world. Currently, more than 50% of ceramics in Japan is produced in this region. It is one of the most important region and culture we Japanese people have to preserve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mlks6kAtL._AC_SL1152_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mino Ware","source_asin":"B08LLB9Z7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LLB9Z7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LLB9Z7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838030,"name":"Honey-Can-Do Holiday Tree Storage Bag, Red, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zwS4qTD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You didn’t think you could stuff anymore until fun into your holidays until you discovered this massive Holiday Tree Storage Bag. Now you and all 55 inches of its roomy interior can indulge in holiday excess like the pros you are. Ideal for storing artificial trees and wreaths, this Santa-red bag even knows how to throw a party for your wrapping paper rolls. Its free form design can help make all your paper storage ideas take shape, too. And for extra cheer, the durable storage bag repels moisture, dusts and pests trying to sneak a peek at their presents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zwS4qTD6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honey-Can-Do","source_asin":"B005G6TIR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005G6TIR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005G6TIR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
