window.products.push({"id":838095,"name":"KneadAce Sourdough Starter Jar With Date Marked Feeding Band, Thermometer, Sourdough Fermentation Jar Scraper, Sewn Cloth Cover & Metal Lid, Sourdough","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eAsZ-fw3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sourdough kit Like No Other - This wide mouth sourdough starter container has absolutely everything you need to create & maintain your sourdough starters: Wide mouth jar for easy adding, stirring & cleaning, last fed on line, which relates directly to the graduated feeding date band, thermometer, unbleached sewn to size cloth cover & metal lid. Never Forget The Last Time You Fed Your Starter - Elastic band marked with the days of the week & the time of day gives you an accurate indication of when you last fed your sour dough starter and the starting feeding level. Simply move the band sideways to indicate the time of feeding and up and down to mark you starting feeding level. The Perfect Size and Shape - At 24 oz. this sour dough maker jar is large enough to provide sourdough starter for 3 loaves of bread while not taking up too much precious space in your fridge. Wide mouth & round, so it is easy to feed, stir & clean. In addition, the net weight of the jar & graduated amount line printed on the jar so you can easily know the weight of your starters. Make Your Own Sourdough Starter - We will provide you with a clear walkthrough video and recipe, so you will easily create your sourdough starter from scratch. Sourdough bread baking is the most popular hobby of our time and you simply can not go wrong by giving this as a gift to anyone who loves baking bread. Your Satisfaction Guaranteed - The KneadAce Sourdough Starter Jar Set has been developed by an industrial designer with a passion for baking. Your sourdough bread baking supplies should be the best and you can not get better than this premium sourdough jar. Throw out your old jars, the KneadAce Jar is attractive as well as being truly efficient and all you need for the perfect starter dough.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eAsZ-fw3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KNEADACE","source_asin":"B0BZDCVBG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZDCVBG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZDCVBG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
