window.products.push({"id":838304,"name":"Winged Sirenny Silk Throw Streamer 98\" (250cm), Church Worship Praise Prophetic Dance Banner with Rod, Flowing Rhythmic Playsilk…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xD5q1H+nL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Silk Imported Keep dry and clean. Avoid washing or getting wet. A throw streamer has a elastic pouch on its rod where you can keep the fabric. The fabric bursts out with a throw, which is why it is called “throw streamer”. The pouch also keep the fabric untangled during storage. Made of soft light weighted silk and strong Acrylic rods, flowing effortlessly, the streamers are not only good church ministry items, but also funny play silks for kids and adults, women and men. Price is for a single piece. Buy 2 to get 1 pair. Important: You MUST steam iron the silk to erase the its fold lines when you receive it, otherwise the fabric will not float. The fabric is 98” long, 36” wide (2.5m x 0.9m) 5mm light weight real silk, carefully hand painted colors with smooth gradations. No runny or heavily dyed patches and free of smudges or odors. The rod is 19” (48cm) Acrylic, crystal-clean or wrapped with silk. The whole streamer weighs about 3.4 ounces (95 grams), including the rod which weighs 1.8 ounces (50 grams). The streamer has no swivels. If you keep swirling it in one direction, it will get entangled. If you find the fabric too heavy and does not float, PLEASE MAKE SURE TO ERASE THE SILK FOLD LINES with a steaming iron. You will see the silk reborn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xD5q1H+nL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winged Sirenny","source_asin":"B01N0P7N30","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838304","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0P7N30","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0P7N30","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
