window.products.push({"id":838320,"name":"Laurel Initial Personalized Wood Lazy Susan - Laser Engraved 14-Inch Diameter Turntable Tray, Kitchen Counter and Dining Room Table Stand, Smooth Rota","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715JcmF0W6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"***Decorative Details With Elegant Engraving*** Bring a touch of elegance to your countertop or table! Lillian Vernon’s Laurel Initial Lazy Susan adds a lovely finishing touch to your kitchen or dining area, with personalized engraving that makes each piece truly your own. Our single-tiered spinning centerpieces fuse modern minimalism into a timeless design that is both practical and beautiful, creating a space that is dressed to impress.  These 14-inch round servers are carefully crafted and sturdy enough for daily use. They are ideal for parties and entertaining and can be used as a cheese board, spice rack, cookie tray, utensil holder, or decorative platter for cakes and desserts. These low-maintenance turntables are easy to clean, and can simply be wiped down as needed. To make our lazy susans truly your own, click the Customize Now button and add the 4 digit year and 1 engraved initial. We will personalize each piece with a classic font engraved into the sleek wooden top.  This countertop carousel is perfect for decorating with seasonal details that make every gathering special and unique. From Christmas to birthdays, housewarmings, anniversaries, and graduation parties, these turning trays are a great way to add a fine finishing touch to any celebration. With classic inspirations, these turntables upgrade any space and make great gifts for friends and family of all ages. They are a personal and thoughtful way to show newlyweds, new homeowners, and loved ones how much you care.  At Lillian Vernon, we aim to carry on the legacy of our founder. Since 1951, we have designed memorable gifts that bring people together and celebrate life’s momentous occasions. With an expansive catalog of thoughtful gifts and personalized options, we specialize in crafting decorative details with exceptional quality that make a house feel like home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715JcmF0W6L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lillian Vernon","source_asin":"B0BNT5KJ9F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNT5KJ9F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNT5KJ9F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838321,"name":"Moss & Stone 2 Piece Cutting Boards for Kitchen & Chef Knife | Polypropylene and Dishwasher Safe | 2 Chopping Board with Grip Handle | BPA-Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pcNqXmKTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAFE AND CLEAN - We at Moss & Stone want to ensure the long-term durability of the cutting board set so we used Polypropylene (PP) material that it's makes the used much easier and easy cleaining & dishwasher safe for sanitizing ,as well our surface won’t retain stains or odors for long-term use KITCHEN SET OF 2 PLASTIC CUTTING BOARD & KNIFE - Set of 2 convenient sizes cutting boards It is something that is consumed and useful and meets the requirements of your kitchen accessories, very easy to maneuver & store. Small cutting board size X 1 piece ( 13.1 in x 7.8 x 0.3 in) Large cutting board size X 1 piece ( 15.9 in X 9.4 X 0.3 in ) & 1 piece stainless steel chef knife. PROFESSIONAL AND COMFORT CHEF KNIFE - Multipurpose chef’s knife design is known for versatility in all types of food preparation: chopping, mincing,slicing, and more ,Fully forged construction offers durability and a seamless transition from blade to handle ,Professional satin-finished blade boasts precision cutting and is finely honed for long-lasting sharpness ,Ergonomic, traditional triple-rivet handle gives balance and comfort When used , as well the knife is easy to clean & Dishwasher safe . NON-SLIP & STABLE TO MAKE CUTTING EASIER - Non slip (TPR) edges to reduce board movement on the bench (around the handles and the bottom Of the cutting board) to makes it safe to use on any kitchen surface. HIGH QUALITY - the plastic cutting boards design with a convenient handle and with a thicker surface for easy used ,Will not dull knives and resists cracking, warping and chipping. CUSTOMER SUPPORT - We at Moss & Stone, offer not only top quality cutting boards for kitchen, but also provide 1-Year warranty withe top of the line customer service which you won't get with other brands that sell cutting board plastic & kitchen essentials!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pcNqXmKTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moss & Stone","source_asin":"B08BPCRL24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BPCRL24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BPCRL24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
