window.products.push({"id":838326,"name":"E-Jen Premium Kimchi, Sauerkraut Container Probiotic Fermentation with Inner Vacuum Lid (Earthenware Brown, 0.45 gal/ 1.7L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412-GPP7FlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Easy to use and easy to handle unlike heavy crock jars. Perfect for any kind of pickling from Kimchi to Sauerkraut. E-Jen storage container comes with an adjustable pressing plate that acts as an inner vacuum. Fermentation allows food to retain more vitamins and minerals than other types of preserving. The pressing plate keeps the kimchi/pickles in an airtight space promoting an anaerobic state benefiting the growth of probiotics (lactobacillus). The design and shape of the containers make it easy to store goods in both the refrigerator and in the pantry without taking too much space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412-GPP7FlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"e-jen","source_asin":"B078TZN6HC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078TZN6HC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078TZN6HC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838327,"name":"VOFANK Set of 2 Boho Throw Pillow Covers 20x20 Inch, Cotton Woven Jacquard Pattern Neutral Decorative Pillow Cases for Sofa Couch Bedroom Living Room,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nT+ohZXtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Boho Style - Decorative pillow covers is designed with a woven geometric pattern with hand-knotted tassels. Combining bohemian style and Nordic styles, it is simple and casual without losing noble and luxurious. This is cool addition to add hues to your space. High Quality Materials - The front of the throw pillow cover is woven with 100% safety cotton blended material; the back is made of pure cotton. Skin-friendly, healthy and durable. Compared with other similar products, it is more wear-resistant and safer. Perfect Decor - This 20x20 pillow cover is a fun way to add comfort to the room. Whether it is bohemian, modern, retro or farmhouse style, it can be a good match. Put a pillow cover on the sofa, bed, couch, and bay window to create a casual and refined feeling in your home. Perfect Gift - Unique appearance and excellent quality make it stand out among many decorative pillow covers. Very suitable for gifts to mother, wife, friends, relatives or newlyweds. It is also the best choice for gifts on special days such as birthdays, housewarming banquets, Christmas, weddings, and anniversaries. Washing Instructions - We recommend washing the pillow covers by hand separately. If you want to machine wash, put the pillowcase in a laundry bag and choose a gentle washing method. There may be some floating fibers in the first cleaning, which is normal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nT+ohZXtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOFANK","source_asin":"B095KNFBNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095KNFBNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095KNFBNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838328,"name":"WellnessMats Linen 3/4\" Anti-Fatigue Mat - Comfort & Support - Non-Slip, Non-Toxic - 36\"x24\"x3/4\" Sand Dollar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFpuBIAZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% Polyurethane LINEN COLLECTION - The Linen Collection provides a subtle, textured pattern with the appearance of a naturally woven fabric; a perfect complement to every room. Linen is sure to become an immediate classic with its delicately interwoven impression and twelve inspired colors to match virtually every décor. From rich, bold tones to elegant, antique finishes, this premium standing solution is a beautiful option for every place (and every space) where standing occurs. LINEN COLLECTION - The Linen Collection provides a subtle, textured pattern with the appearance of a naturally woven fabric; a perfect complement to every room. Linen is sure to become an immediate classic with its delicately interwoven impression and twelve inspired colors to match virtually every décor. From rich, bold tones to elegant, antique finishes, this premium standing solution is a beautiful option for every place (and every space) where standing occurs. LINEN COLLECTION - The Linen Collection provides a subtle, textured pattern with the appearance of a naturally woven fabric; a perfect complement to every room. Linen is sure to become an immediate classic with its delicately interwoven impression and twelve inspired colors to match virtually every décor. From rich, bold tones to elegant, antique finishes, this premium standing solution is a beautiful option for every place (and every space) where standing occurs. SUPERIOR STANDING SUPPORT - We all spend a lot of time on our feet while cooking, washing dishes, using a vanity, doing hobbies, and very often while we work. Standing for periods of time on hard surfaces can put stress on your body (feet, ankles, knees, hips, and back), causing fatigue, aches and pains. Our ergonomically designed mats provide cushioned support with a soft, smooth surface and buoyant core which helps to reduce muscle and joint fatigue as well as stress on the lower extremities. SAFE, NON-TOXIC - Made from our proprietary Advanced Polyurethane Technology, our mats will never delaminate, the edges will never curl, nor will our mats puncture or slide. Our mats are safe, non-toxic and latex free providing non-slip top and bottom surfaces with ADA Compliant, 20° no-trip beveled edges. WellnessMats will forever remain buoyant and supportive bringing you years of comfort and well-being. QUALITY COMFORT - We take pride in supporting the health and well-being of our customers and the economy in our communities. Our mats are proudly made 100% in the USA and come with an unprecedented 20-Year Warranty. For over 20 years we have been meticulously crafting our â€œBest-in-Classâ€  anti-fatigue products to complement and adapt to any décor. From the high-quality construction, to the luxurious comfort and support, each step reaffirms your decision to own a WellnessMat. EASY TO CLEAN & MAINTAIN - Designed to provide comfort and well-being, all of our products require little to no special care. Most spills or surface stains can easily be cleaned with warm water and a towel or mop. For more difficult stains, mild soap and water are recommended. WellnessMats can be spot cleaned, swept, or stick vacuumed (non-brush rolled) as needed. We recommend that you always test our products with any chemicals to be used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFpuBIAZL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wellness Mat","source_asin":"B07B4596GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4596GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4596GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
