window.products.push({"id":838367,"name":"GOODVAC Power Nozzle Kit Compatible with Filter Queen Vacuum Cleaners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MHeReS8fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"GOODVAC Brand Replacement Power nozzle for Filter Queen Deluxe Power Nozzle Kit by GoodVac This is a high quality durable GoodVac Deluxe Brand power nozzle with electric hose and telescoping wand. Designed to fit Filter Queen Vacuums: Triple Crown Limited Edition Majestic Majestic 70th Anniversary Majestic 75th Anniversary Princess II AN95-X AN95 99 99A 31X D31X D33 RN92 PNG92  The GoodVac Deluxe Power Nozzle Kit includes the GoodVac Deluxe Power Nozzle with LED Headlight and Height Adjustment, 7' Electrified hose with on / off switch and telescoping nozzle wand that extends from 25\" up to 39\". The GoodVac Deluxe Power Nozzle is durable and lightweight with bright LED Headlight. Comes with 5 position height adjustment and designed to clean all carpet types including ultra soft and plush carpeting. Gentle on carpets and deep and effective cleaning.  Features: LED headlight - Extra Bright and Long Life Reinforced Long Life Belt Soft Rubber Wheels Auto-Stop Feature turns of nozzle if jammed. Locking neck with release pedal for quick release of wands Large edge cleaning channels to clean closer to edges and baseboards Extra large intake for more efficient cleaning and less clogging Air-flow control squeegee for hard surface floors V Shaped Bristles provide deep and efficient cleaning Locking neck assembly for convenient on/off function 5-Step height adjustment 1 Year Limited Warranty* *1 Year Limited Warranty through GoodVac, covers manufacturer defects, does not cover parts that wear and tear (ie brushrolls, belts) or damage from misuse or abuse.  Disclaimer: We are not an authorized Health-Mor distributor. We are not affiliated with Filter Queen vacuum manufacturer in any way. None of the Filter Queen branded products and non-OEM replacement parts come with manufacturers warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MHeReS8fL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOODVAC","source_asin":"B07BFGDT12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFGDT12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFGDT12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
