window.products.push({"id":838437,"name":"COSTWAY Portable Evaporative Air Cooler for Room, 40-Inch Bladeless Cooling Tower Cooler with Remote Control, 4 Ice Packs, 4 Speeds, 7H Timer, 60° Osc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XcPezRDrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️ [4 Fan Speeds & Wide Oscillation] The cooling tower fan comes with 4 speed settings for you to customize your desired airflow. Featuring 60° wide oscillation and a 14-inch long wind outlet, this evaporative air cooler can deliver cooling breeze in a wider coverage. Moreover, by adding water and ice boxes (4pcs included), you can enjoy extra coolness. ❄️ [Smart Touch Panel & Remote Control] The top-mounted touch control panel with LED indicator lights is easy and convenient to use, especially for seniors and pregnant women. Besides, with a handy remote control, you can lay back and stay comfy on the sofa or bed to control the cooling tower fan. ❄️ [Compact Size & 3-in-1 Design] With a compact and lightweight design, this swamp cooler won't take up much of floor space and it is easy to transport anywhere you need it. Featuring a 3-in-1 design including cooling, ventilating and dehumidifying, this air cooler can meet your various needs. ❄️ [Quiet Operation & 7H Timer] This evaporative cooler runs quietly with a working sound lower than 60.5dB, creating a peaceful and cozy working or sleeping environment for you. The built-in timer allows you to set the auto-off time from 1-7 hours. In addition, the 1.3-gallon large capacity water tank allows you to enjoy coolness all night. ❄️ [Safety Protection] Compared to an air conditioner, this evaporative air cooler uses no chemical refrigerants and can save a lot of energy costs. The stable round base prevents the cooler from tipping over. What's more, with the bladeless design and ETL certification, this air cooler ensures safety and long-term use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XcPezRDrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B0B1DJM9K2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DJM9K2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DJM9K2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
