window.products.push({"id":838469,"name":"EDSAL UR245AZ-BLK Steel Storage Rack, 5 Adjustable Shelves, 4000 lb. Capacity, 72\" Height x 48\" Width x 24\" Depth, Black (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5WrRaX3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Edsal UR245AZ-BLK storage rack has a frame made of steel for strength with a smooth black finish for resistance to corrosion, five adjustable particle board shelves, and a 4,000 lb. capacity when the weight is evenly distributed across all shelves. It is suitable for organizing and storing items. The shelves are supported by double-riveted beams and braces for strength, and adjust in 1-1/2\" increments to accommodate items of varying heights. The posts on this shelving unit have a two-piece design so it can be assembled vertically to create one 72 x 48 x 24 inch (H x W x D) unit, or assembled horizontally to create one 36 x 48 x 24 inch (H x W x D) unit with two shelves, and one 36 x 48 x 24inch (H x W x D) unit with three shelves. (H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back.) This shelving unit's rivet lock design requires no nuts or bolts for assembly. Assembly instructions are included, tools for assembly are not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5WrRaX3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDSAL","source_asin":"B084HL873C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084HL873C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084HL873C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838470,"name":"NORTHOME Olive Oil Dispenser Glass Bottle Cruet 25 oz Lead-Free with Stainless Steel lid and Vinegar Bottles for Kitchen Cooking Container set 1pcs (2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31E5vChI9TL._AC_.jpg","description":"✔ 【PERFECT DESIGN】：Our Olive Oil Dispenser, With A Stainless Steel Lid And A Bamboo Lid, Allows You To Choose Your Style From The Color Categories. The Oil Jug Has A Milliliter Scale That Allows You To Control The Amount Of Olive Oil Or Vinegar You Use While Cooking. And We Also Have A Silica Cap That Keeps Out The Dust, And A Silica Base That Prevents Collisions. Let You Use It In The Kitchen, Safe Rest Assured. We'Ve Added A Scale To The Body So You Can See Exactly How Much Is Used. ✔ 【MATERIAL DESCRIPTION】：We Use Heat-Resistant Borosilicate Glass, Which Can Withstand Instantaneous Temperature Difference From -20℃ To 150℃. So, You Don't Have To Worry About This Olive Oil Can Get Into The Dishwasher And Break When It Gets High-Temperature. One Of The Lids Is Made Of Food-Grade 304 Stainless Steel, And The Other Is Made Of Bamboo Lids. All Sealed Silica Gel In Contact With Food Is Food Grade, and You Can Rest Assured. ✔ 【SAFE】：Glass Has High Transparency And Is Also Lead-Free. With Food-Grade Sealed Silica Gel, You Don'T Have To Worry About Whether The Material Is Unsafe To Affect Your Health. We Made A Gap In The Silicone Ring Of The Lid So That The External Air Pressure Could Enter The Oil Pot, Which Was Not A Flaw. When You Pour Olive Oil Or Vinegar, You'Ll Feel Smoother And Easier To Pour Out. ✔ 【IN USE】：It Can Be Used For Cooking Condiments Such As Olive Oil, Vinegar, And Soy Sauce. Strong Handle, Very Durable. It Also Has A Drip-Proof Hawk That Doesn'T Run Down The Spout After You'Ve Poured The Oil. There Will Be A Dust Cap On The Spout To Prevent Dust From Getting Into The Oil Can. The Bottom Is A Collision-Proof Silicone Base, So You Don't Have To Worry About Crashing Into Your Hard Table. ✔ 【SERVICE】：Northome Has Always Been Pursuing High-Quality Kitchen Supplies. All The Products Were Launched After We Had Used Them For A Long Time After The Design Was Completed And Confirmed To Be Acceptable To Most Users. Our Service Is, If You Are Not Satisfied, You Can Choose To Return It. If You Are Willing To Tell Us What You Do Not Like, We Will Be More Willing. Any Comments About The Product Can Give Us A Message.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31E5vChI9TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NORTHOME","source_asin":"B082G5W74D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082G5W74D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082G5W74D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
