window.products.push({"id":838473,"name":"Holy Land Market Heavy Jerusalem Olive Wood Carved Heart Key Chain or ring - 2 inches long and 1 inch thick","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OKmcdMBMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A special and unusual gift to give with love. This beautiful olive wood carved heart is made from olive trees from the Jerusalem area. Craftsmen living in the Holy Land have carved this 'heart' by hand. Holding the aromatic wood feels just right in your hand and you will never lose your keys and hopefully your way in life! Over time this heart will develop its own natural patina adding hues and richness. This is a beautiful keepsake and practical too. Please note that no two hearts look exactly the same as the wood will differ in color and vein pattern. The olive wood tree is indigenous to the Holy Land and is treasured for its oil, fruit and the wood. Note : Chain is gold or silver tone ( see photos please ).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OKmcdMBMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holy Land Market","source_asin":"B003IQ0OJU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003IQ0OJU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003IQ0OJU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
