window.products.push({"id":838476,"name":"EPROSMIN Above Ground Pool Pump and Filter - 800GPH Pool Filter Pump for Inflatable Swimming Pools Water Cleaning Filter Cartridge Pump Easy Set Pool ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f8CGokndL._AC_SL1162_.jpg","description":"Are you still worried about how to change and clean the swimming pool? Our swimming pool filter pump can completely solve your problem. This filter pump for above ground pool is an effective tool to keep the swimming pool clean. Keep your pool water clear and refreshing this summer with the pool filter pump. Features: 1.Water saving: If the filter pump is not used, the water should be changed every 2-3 days.Use swimming pool filter pump, change the water about 5-7 days (the water quality is different in different places, and the water change time is different). 2.The pool filter pump is suitable for most brand types of inflatable swimming pools, such as intex / bestway / summer wave. 3.The filter element can be replaced, easy to clean, safe and sanitary. 4. Pool filter includes hose and filter element, everything you need for installation. Tips: 1.The filter pump must be used with water flowing, otherwise the internal components of the filter pump will be burned out. 2.Do not use swimming pool filter pump when people are in the water. 3.If air resistance occurs in the filter pump, there is a pressure reducing valve on the top. Turn the valve counterclockwise. When a small amount of water comes out, tighten it immediately, and the filter pump can be completely flushed again. Specification: Type: pool filter pump Material: PVC Rated voltage: 110V-120V Power: 90W Water flow: 800 gallons/hour Package Included: 1 x pool filter pump 1 x cartridge filter 2 x filter chamber 2 x filter hose 4 x hose clamp 1 x plug After-sales Service: If you have any questions about our pool pumps, you can contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51f8CGokndL._AC_SL1162_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EPROSMIN","source_asin":"B0B5G93DQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5G93DQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5G93DQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
