window.products.push({"id":838576,"name":"vancasso Ramekins 8 OZ, Ramekin Set of 6, Ceramic Oven Safe Ramekins, Creme Brulee Ramekins for Baking, Porcelain Ramekins for Desserts Puddings Souff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TROvfI8DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>【 Long Lasting & Scratch Resistant】</b> - The vancasso ramekins set of 6 made of high quality food grade reactive glaze and stoneware, free of pba, lead or cadmium. High temperature calcination ensure an outstanding hardness and stability of the ceramic baking ramekins, uniform with smooth glaze non-porous avoid erosion by dust and food flavoring sauces, sturdy and durable. <b>【Perfect Portion Size】</b> - This cute creme brulee ramekin with a capacity of 8 oz is great for preparing serving desserts like souffle dishes, molten lava cake, pudding, ice cream, dips, muffin, mug cake, snacks, guacamole, sauces, quiche, appetizers, nuts, cheese and more, and also ideal for portion controlled of meal. <b>【Speace- Saving In Kitchen】</b> - These mini ramekins is stackable to be simply piled up for saving lots of space in your cupboard, and easy to carry on during a picnic or camping. Beautiful nebula color and pattern make this porcelain ramekins match to both modern and vintage style. <b>【Dishwasher & Microwave & Oven Safe】</b> - The versatile souffle ramekin supprt to be used in microwaves and oven with up to 500°F, an ideal choice for baking. Non-stick glaze of the sauce ramekins is convenient for cleaning of food grease and residue, the color with no fading and gloss keeps like new even after long time use and washed. <b>【 Ideal Gift Choice】</b> - this set of 6 ceramic ramekins with smooth lines and easy to grip, delicate design helps to make food looks more appetizing and attractive and brings a better dining experience for your guests. We guarantee a no-worry return policy for any quality problem, please don't hesitate to contact us if you receive a broken or defective product, we will offer you a refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TROvfI8DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vancasso","source_asin":"B08JYC4TML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYC4TML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYC4TML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":838577,"name":"Hisencn Ceramic Gas Fireplace Logs Set for Firebowl, Vented, Gel, Electric Gas Inserts, Propane, Logs Decor, Ethanol Fireplaces, Indoor or Outdoor Fir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7155QeWHv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Product Description】Package includes 6 pcs logs, Each log is approximately 15.7 - 12.2 inches long x 3.3 to 5.1 inches in diameter. Suitable for your fireplace or fire pit. Picture shown here is indicative only. The actual product may differ.➤If you have any questions about the order, please contact us 【Suitable for All Type of Fireplace Or Fire Pit】Hisencn Gas Fireplace Logs Set, Ceramic Logs Set is perfect for vented gas fireplace, Outdoor & indoor gas fireplaces, direct vent, zero clearance, natural gas, gel fireplaces, standard fire pits, fake fireplaces, ethanol fireplaces, electric fireplace inserts, propane fireplaces, etc. 【Realistic Decoration】Ceramic fiber artificial fake wood, decorative fireplace logs have a natural and realistic look, you’ll even see some orange/red hot spots under the logs while burning, look just like real wood logs burning. They won't leave your fireplace looking bare. ➤ if there is not enough air or is too close to the fire source, the wood may appear charred, which makes the wood look more realistic. 【Clean and Harmless】Real logs produce carbon dioxide during burning, which is dangerous when the doors and windows are not ventilated in winter. Hisencn gas fireplace logs can withstand the most extreme temperatures without damage or crumbling, keep fire logs in a good shape. It also doesn’t create toxic fumes, soot or or ash in the fire like some lower quality fireplace logs, and cool quickly. 【MULTIPLE USE】 Hisencn Gas Fireplace Logs Set can be used by itself or can be mixed with current gas logs, crackle flame firelogs, fire starters, glowing embers, fire starters, and lava rocks. Can also be used as decorative home pieces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7155QeWHv0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hisencn","source_asin":"B07ZSBB4Y4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZSBB4Y4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZSBB4Y4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
