window.products.push({"id":838592,"name":"Reusable Chalkboard Labels by Dandelion Fun - Set of 56 - Removable - Approx. 3.5 inches by 2 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815L426aBSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"YOUR SEARCH FOR THE BEST CHALKBOARD LABELS IS FINALLY OVER! You won’t find a better value for this quality of label anywhere. If you were only using them once, that’s less than 36 cents each. Because these labels last, like no other brand does, their value keeps increasing, as do your savings. There are 7 identical sheets in the package, giving you 7 each of 8 stylish designs - 56 labels that are approximately 2” X 3.5”. Need some smaller labels? Take a pair of sewing scissors or an X-Acto knife and cut the rectangular shaped labels to the size you desire. You can stick these labels to anything. They are reusable when used on glass, plastic, metal, stainless steel, terra cotta, ceramic, wood, glossy magazines, Ziploc freezer bags, and heavy duty tinfoil. When you stick them to paper or cardboard boxes, they won’t be reusable. Recommended: Do not stick on painted surfaces. Dishwasher safe. Labels not only stay on in the dishwasher, they can even be removed afterwards and stuck on another container. TIPS: Apply from the center and push out from there to smoothly apply the sticker. This is the easiest way to make sure you get no air bubbles. Our preference for writing on the labels is a paint pen (not oil based) because the writing will not come off when it gets wet. Favorite brand is Craft Smart-the white, fine tip paint pen. You can find it at craft stores. USES: Labeling in kitchen, pantry, freezer, fridge, canning, wine making, weddings, storage bins, arts & craft supplies, scrapbooking, entertaining & dinner parties, buffets, home office, garage, shop, retail stores, businesses, name badges, classrooms, binders, kids rooms, toy bins… Thank you for purchasing our labels. We’re sure you’re going to love them!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815L426aBSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dandelion Fun","source_asin":"B00L8C3PQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L8C3PQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L8C3PQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
