window.products.push({"id":838756,"name":"LauKingdom Toaster 4 Slice, Stainless Steel Toaster with Extra Wide Slots, Bagels, Defrost, Cancel Function, Dual Independent Control with 6 Shade Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+W1b9pr3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Dual independent control】 When only two slices of bread are needed for one person's breakfast, you can push only one lever of the bread machine so as not to waste energy. When it is necessary to prepare bread for the whole family, it can work on both sides at the same time. This not only saves time, but also allows you to bake different tastes of bread by adjusting the gears to meet the different needs of your family. 【Multiple gears adjustment】There are 6 heating gears for you to choose when you pull down the lever. From fluffy to crispy, from light to golden brown. The bread will pop out automatically when finished. 【Wider Baking Slot】1.5 feet extra wide slot is suitable for many sizes of bread - waffles, English muffins, slices of bread with different thicknesses, etc. It can provide you with different delicious choices every morning. 【3 Smart Functions】This smart toaster oven has three smart functions.Defrost: Can't do anything about the bread you just took out of the fridge? Let the defrost function help you. bagel: bake only one side of the bread. cancel: stop the machine at any time with a button, providing an additional layer of safety for your cooking. 【Thoughtful design】The stainless steel plate at the bottom will collect the crumbs that fall during the baking process. You just need to use water or wipe it gently with a rag to clean it up. The cord can also be collected under the chassis after use, saving space and making your kitchen look well organized.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+W1b9pr3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LauKingdom","source_asin":"B09T6FB736","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T6FB736","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T6FB736","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
