window.products.push({"id":838870,"name":"Reusable Food Storage Bags 8 Pack Reusable Snack Bags Extra Thick Reusable Sandwich Bags FDA Grade Freezer Ziplock Lunch Bags for Food Fruits Snacks L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DO+XRU7LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Still using Plastic bags? We sincerely invite you to join the ranks of defending the earth; say goodbye to white plastic life from using our food storage bags. Feature: 1.Easy to Clean: You can wash these reusable snack bags with warm water and mild detergent, air dry or wipe with a clean cloth. 2.Transparent: The transparent design makes ziplock food baggies easy for you to browse the internal content and quickly find what you want. The different colors are also designed to distinguish different things, such as raw meat and cooked meat. 3.Freezing safety: Thick PEVA material, can prevent the FDA grade lunch bags from being cracked after being placed in the refrigerator. 4.Widely used: Not only for food storage, but also for the storage of cosmetics, jewelry, stationery, etc. Sweet Tips: 1.Hand wash these reusable baggies with warm or cold water, air dry; not recommend used in dishwasher;  2.Avoid storing hot food and putting in the microwave for heating;  3.Make sure to tighten the zipper seal to prevent leakage;  4.There may be a slight odor which is unavoidable when the product is received; however, this does not affect the use of the product; it is recommended that wash them with warm water and detergent before use for the first time and put it in a ventilated place，keep these bags open; Specifications: Product Name: Reusable Storage Bag Material: PEVA Color: Light green, dark green, red, yellow Quantity: 8 pcs Package Size: 8.66 * 7.75 * 1.18 inch Package Weight: 0.32 kg Package included: 8 pcs reusable storage bags Any problems you feel unsatisfied with your purchase, please feel free to contact us. We will do everything possible to provide you with the best experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DO+XRU7LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ieGeek","source_asin":"B07W8L2Q69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-838870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W8L2Q69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W8L2Q69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
